    "notes": "Biomembrane force probe (biotinylated human RBC + streptavidin bead coated with recombinant PD-L1/PD-L2 ectodomains) probing PD-1 on Jurkat cells; force-clamp bond lifetime measurements reveal PD-1/PD-L1 and PD-1/PD-L2 catch-slip bonds, plus adhesion-frequency assays (20 pN impingement, 0.2 s contact). Multiple PD-L1 point mutants tested; SMD simulations, DNA tension-gauge-tether beads, T-cell functional assays and mouse tumour studies are complementary, non-SMFS parts."
